e the other  relations are really talking form  it seems and that is really very  distressing so officer Kensington Palace  are going to be very upset for her that  just also describes how Thomas markle's  broken her heart into a million pieces  saying to hear about the attacks you've  made at Harry in the press who was  nothing but patient kind and  understanding with you is perhaps the  most painful of all  while mr. markl insists he wants to  reunite with Megan  the reality is far from what the Royals  would want this father-daughter  relationship is now more than ever a  public open wound Adelle Robinson Sky  News
 

